WEBVTT

00:16:59.288 --> 00:17:02.724
plutocrats hiding their assets in tax havens,

00:17:02.724 --> 00:17:06.644
or powerful lobbies protecting the powerful few.

00:17:06.644 --> 00:17:12.077
It is in their interest that all of us are idiots.

00:17:12.077 --> 00:17:13.563
Let's not be.

00:17:13.563 --> 00:17:14.803
Thank you.

00:17:14.803 --> 00:17:26.713
(Applause)

00:17:26.713 --> 00:17:28.626
Bruno Giussani: You seem to describe a political leadership

00:17:28.626 --> 00:17:30.811
that is kind of unprepared